  "caption": "Free AI website banaye bina coding: Gemini Canvas se mohalle ki dukaan ki site, aur pehla client dhoondho.\n\n3 step:\n1. Gemini kholo, Canvas chuno, likho: \"meri bakery ki mobile website banao, WhatsApp order button ke saath\"\n2. Preview dekho, badlav bolo, phir Share dabake link copy karo\n3. Wo link dukaan wale ko WhatsApp karo: \"Bhaiya, aapki dukaan ki website banayi hai\"\n\nHaan bole to: code ko index.html file mein save karo, Netlify Drop pe daalo aur Netlify ke free plan pe sign up karke site claim karo.\n\nSach bhi jaan lo: Canvas sabhi Gemini users ke liye hai, Google account chahiye. Gemini ka Web page option abhi 18+ ke liye hai. Free plans ki limits Google aur Netlify badal sakte hain.\n\n5 dukaan x Rs 3,000 = Rs 15,000. Ye sirf example hai, guarantee nahi. Mehnat tumhari.\n\nPrompt chahiye? Comment mein WEBSITE likho, sabko reply karunga. Roz aisi ek kaam ki AI trick ke liye follow karo.\n\n#aitools #aihindi #aitoolsforfree #geminiai #websitedesign"
